AU  - SMITH, IVAN
TI  - FLOER COHOMOLOGY AND PENCILS OF QUADRICS
DA  - D:20241126
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/1006.1099
AB  - There is a classical relationship in algebraic geometry between a hyperelliptic curve and an associated pencil of quadric hypersurfaces. We investigate symplectic aspects of this relationship, with a view to applications in low-dimensional topology.
